<title>SRI LANKA: Lanka Walltile says '96 net down 28 pct.</title>
<headline>Lanka Walltile says '96 net down 28 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Lanka Walltile Ltd for the 12 months ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>	   (in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			    1996		    1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	  1,274.01  vs	    940.54</p>
<p>    Net profit	   53.71   vs	    74.27</p>
<p>    Tax provision	27.42   vs	    62.12</p>
<p>NOTE - Lanka Walltile makes ceramic tiles mainly for exports.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
